abstract: >-
  Theory notes and the PlanetaryGeostrophy Julia package for
  solving the linear, steady, robust-diagnostic planetary
  geostrophic equations with resolved Ekman layers over arbitrary
  bathymetry, with depth-integrated momentum and vorticity
  diagnostics and adjoint sensitivities.
